# BuildKit reads this file instead of a .dockerignore when it builds the Dockerfile beside it.
# The build context is this folder; only these paths go into the build. model/ is there only in a local app's
# folder (Home Assistant's own build), never in the repository.
*
!requirements.lock
!hunch_app/
!page/
!model/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
